{"title":"Manuale olosecurity · OLOtheme","slug":"olosecurity-manuale","kind":"page","content":[{"id":"80e8ab13-f5d0-4e7f-9312-68eb2c647d77","type":"section","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"light_color":"#26B8E8","style":"default","width":"default","padding":"custom","padding_top_custom":130,"padding_bottom_custom":30,"bg_scope":"section","sticky_effect":"none"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"4fd64962-00dc-46bb-a3e2-e38812f0fe4c","type":"row","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"layout":"100","stack_mobile":true},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"c384b240-b8ee-4adf-b59f-f037ee4674b3","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"1-1"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"a4c0f5cf-2829-4c71-9736-f5aeaac6c889","type":"pagelight","settings":{"light_color":"#26B8E8","base_color":"#0C0E13","position":"top-right","size":95,"intensity":22,"transition_ms":800},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"52e07be8-aee8-4ef9-ad76-d356eb7973f4","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"doc OLO-SEC-M01 · manuale base · + scheda tecnica · v1.2.0","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#8B90A0","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"10","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2.5","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"3a662226-3a51-4a81-8f87-16819cde44b0","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"20"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"5945ea9e-2e71-4862-8672-9f29ec503a87","type":"image","settings":{"image_url":"/wp-content/uploads/olotheme-site/olosecurity-orizz.png","alt_text":"olosecurity","image_width":"170px","height":"auto","object_fit":"contain","image_alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"9f3c3a0e-8069-4ca2-8e3a-f590176af977","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"18"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"a3eb4b6d-a7ef-4a83-b0aa-3d45a92fff84","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Manuale base","accent_text":"base","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h1","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"56","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"af5e571d-e67d-4fa0-b195-462193f87239","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"12"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"a10ec493-57df-45bd-a5fc-e6a16568627e","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<p>Il pannello Sentinel e le quattro linee di difesa: prevenzione, identità, rilevamento, reazione. Tutto elaborato in locale.</p>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"16","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]}]}]}]},{"id":"b7cd147b-c729-434d-ab48-0305133f5299","type":"section","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"light_color":"#26B8E8","style":"default","width":"default","padding":"custom","padding_top_custom":20,"padding_bottom_custom":120,"bg_scope":"section","sticky_effect":"none"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"e7da7e6a-ccf1-417c-99ee-c278c312a3da","type":"row","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"layout":"25-75","stack_mobile":true},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"1d438300-e6cb-4cb8-876b-ceb09e5e7d2e","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"1-4"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"8c391a59-8a77-4501-8196-44ef68f8d8a1","type":"toc","settings":{"title":"Sommario","max_depth":"2","list_style":"numbered","sticky":true,"highlight_active":true,"smooth_scroll":true,"typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","text_color":"#8B90A0","link_color":"#B9BDC9","title_color":"#FAF7F2"},"style":[],"advanced":[]}]},{"id":"6ad9e01d-0c23-4f44-a977-89a47dfb2fc7","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"3-4"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"25b7298b-3974-4406-baa0-3e2ba40e4697","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c1"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"c1ec4547-425e-4bc4-9586-e45bbcdee480","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§1","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"00e6c1c1-b276-4db4-94a1-a405b16306a6","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"2b92795f-0c19-4df0-849b-2edd9402bb55","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Cos’è OLOsecurity","accent_text":"OLOsecurity","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"0a41f5fd-233a-4104-8eec-ca9821da4837","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"f72bc3e4-ad05-4455-9981-387975dd8adb","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<p>OLOsecurity è un plugin di sicurezza WordPress <strong>all-in-one</strong>: firewall, antivirus, gestione accessi con 2FA, audit e bonifica in un unico pannello, <strong>Sentinel</strong>, 8 schede operative.</p><p>La scelta di fondo: <strong>elaborazione 100% locale</strong>. Analisi, firme e log restano sul tuo server; nessun traffico viene spedito a cloud terzi per essere “analizzato”. Nessun dataset di terzi è impacchettato nel plugin: i feed si scaricano on-demand dal tuo sito. GDPR semplice.</p><p><strong>Conformità — </strong>Codice GPL, verificabile riga per riga. <strong>WP Plugin Check: 0 errori / 0 warning.</strong></p>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"e059be2a-a545-4a7e-ae49-3a4d2b336504","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"4edc1d06-f4c7-41d3-a349-d6d44ac98f3c","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c2"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"0dbae09e-29de-414f-9792-0af460a97f31","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§2","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"4c9f34ab-bef3-46d3-a863-2d6ea0b7f704","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"ccc50ba2-09d1-4b4d-9e99-c91513a9022f","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Firewall · mini-WAF","accent_text":"mini-WAF","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"4cf26f56-cae3-445e-973f-9e9583b8f22f","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"9fc7f3bd-21b3-478e-ab1a-0db082ddd857","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Regole per famiglia OWASP</strong>: SQL injection, XSS, path traversal, LFI/RCE, attivabili a gruppi.</li><li><strong>Reputazione IP</strong> da liste pubbliche + regole di blocco avanzate.</li><li><strong>Rate limiting</strong> sulle richieste anomale.</li><li><strong>Geo-blocco</strong> IPv4 e IPv6 per paese.</li><li><strong>Proxy fidati</strong>: riconoscimento di Cloudflare e reti locali per valutare correttamente <code>X-Forwarded-For</code>.</li></ul>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"74a2a27c-1b75-45a0-b0bf-09b3be54b076","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"15b149d9-a55a-48f2-8914-d494df2d3ccb","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c3"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"9e7c52cb-f3b4-4e27-8f0a-d6ae6634369c","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§3","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"beaa0710-d91e-45e4-b660-03a47b026019","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"85ab0383-1412-4742-a24a-af374399f9e9","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Accessi & 2FA","accent_text":"2FA","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"db7597c2-cdab-4ee2-bf42-9ce26c7f9480","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"3b723ef5-e1e2-4b8a-9b63-2854fd933344","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Anti brute-force</strong>: limite tentativi, lockout temporizzato, auto-blocklist permanente per IP recidivi, allowlist/blocklist.</li><li><strong>2FA TOTP</strong>: setup con QR, codici di recupero, fallback email, reset admin.</li><li><strong>Password compromesse</strong>: verifica su HIBP con k-anonymity: la password non lascia mai il server.</li><li><strong>CAPTCHA</strong> e blocco enumerazione utenti.</li><li><strong>Anti finti crawler</strong>: verifica FCrDNS: chi si spaccia per Googlebot viene smascherato.</li><li><strong>Hardening opzionale</strong>: XML-RPC, security header, occultamento versione, <code>DISALLOW_FILE_EDIT</code>, blocco upload PHP, protezione .htaccess.</li></ul>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"ba7ec877-07d9-4927-a63d-48e8c7742c56","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1325f789-75e5-45a5-ad0b-04b118d42713","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c4"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"14b39d19-a058-4259-b2c1-91a8b94e9085","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§4","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1b655c7d-e08c-47f8-9440-018562488800","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"73028bc9-11e8-4e34-9703-ad26b0f85e18","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Scanner · tre passaggi","accent_text":"tre passaggi","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"c8ccc573-efc3-4d20-a25c-b2f1a4d2c00d","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1c5f59d3-4778-40f3-b2ef-f8c204d7bde1","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Integrità / checksum</strong>: baseline trust-on-first-use; confronto di core, plugin e temi con wordpress.org; rileva i file modificati.</li><li><strong>Euristica profonda</strong>: scorre i file PHP (salta i non eseguibili) con 5 euristiche forti calibrate anti falsi-positivi; la doppia estensione mascherata (es. <code>.jpg.php</code>) è trattata come webshell quasi certa.</li><li><strong>Firme malware</strong>: passaggio per hash MD5/SHA256 sul feed firme: lookup O(1), costo trascurabile.</li></ul><p>Prestazioni: <strong>~11.000 file PHP in ~2–3 secondi</strong> su un sito tipico; sugli hosting con timeout, modalità a blocchi con ripresa. Feed CVE per plugin e temi installati, aggiornamento giornaliero via cron, indici con autoload OFF.</p>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1f0900b7-e31a-45f6-b28d-23775bf75eaa","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"6e3b2731-083f-4c62-85cd-0dc29a9c6c31","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"c5"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"175f5f58-1755-4640-945a-77c00dad2086","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"§5","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"12","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"413a87c8-e48d-49b1-a459-41071be6a3c9","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"8"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"5e5d2f43-df07-447e-acfb-4c67d86cf6b0","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Ripristino & registro","accent_text":"registro","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"34","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"6593325d-02af-4ea4-8523-d552366b92ef","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"14"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"6f7da9ba-6fff-4d40-8280-3c2c306a7a0f","type":"text-block","settings":{"content":"<ul><li><strong>Bonifica guidata</strong> post-attacco: riparazione core one-click dalla versione ufficiale, reinstallazione plugin/temi da wordpress.org con backup automatico.</li><li><strong>Quarantena reversibile</strong> dei file sospetti.</li><li><strong>Rigenerazione salt</strong> e report d’incidente pronto da consegnare.</li><li><strong>Audit log</strong> “chi/cosa/quando” su tabella dedicata, filtrabile, export CSV, conservazione 90 giorni.</li><li><strong>Monitoraggio</strong>: traffico in tempo reale, grafico eventi, monitor spazio disco, digest email, webhook.</li></ul>","text_color":"#B9BDC9","font_size":"15","text_align":"left","max_width":"560","tile_padding":{"top":0,"right":0,"bottom":0,"left":0}},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"850e9854-ba05-492e-aac2-b924a272f5d5","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"44"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"0efebbab-f457-4523-8c08-6880900845ff","type":"menuanchor","settings":{"anchor_id":"spec"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"5e26a974-b9f3-48f7-86a0-38f5c263e632","type":"headline","settings":{"heading":"Scheda tecnica","accent_text":"tecnica","accent_color":"#26B8E8","accent_italic":true,"tag":"h2","alignment":"left","heading_size":"lg","heading_font_size":"40","heading_font":"'Fraunces', serif","heading_weight":"400","heading_color":"#FAF7F2","decoration":"none","subtitle":""},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"1ed3d2d0-a74a-4356-b043-5585b6c3d52f","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"10"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"79203c40-3bf8-4a27-8a16-de955ca4c5d4","type":"badge","settings":{"text":"OLOsecurity v1.2.0 · GPLv2 or later · Plugin Check 0/0","variant":"outline","bg_color":"transparent","text_color":"#26B8E8","typography_preset":"olox-mono","font_size":"11","font_weight":"600","text_transform":"uppercase","letter_spacing":"2","padding_y":0,"padding_x":0,"alignment":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"2bb4a691-436c-4b34-a911-b7d35d27448b","type":"spacer","settings":{"height":"22"},"style":[],"advanced":[]},{"id":"452001e4-dd08-4115-9850-11fbb0f6427d","type":"desclist","settings":{"items":[{"id":"sp-0","term":"Tipo","definition":"Plugin di sicurezza WordPress all-in-one · pannello Sentinel, 8 schede","icon":""},{"id":"sp-1","term":"Requisiti","definition":"WordPress 5.9+ (testato fino a WP 7.0) · PHP 7.4+","icon":""},{"id":"sp-2","term":"Elaborazione","definition":"100% locale, nessun traffico verso cloud terzi","icon":""},{"id":"sp-3","term":"Firewall","definition":"Mini-WAF: regole OWASP per famiglia, reputazione IP, rate limiting, geo-blocco IPv4/IPv6","icon":""},{"id":"sp-4","term":"Accessi","definition":"Anti brute-force, 2FA TOTP + recupero, HIBP k-anonymity, CAPTCHA, FCrDNS","icon":""},{"id":"sp-5","term":"Scanner","definition":"Checksum vs wordpress.org · 5 euristiche anti-webshell · hash MD5/SHA256 O(1)","icon":""},{"id":"sp-6","term":"Prestazioni","definition":"~11.000 file PHP in ~2–3 s · modalità a blocchi con ripresa","icon":""},{"id":"sp-7","term":"Feed","definition":"maldet/rfxn.com, InterServer (~76.000 firme) · OpenPhish + URLhaus (~30.000 URL) · api.wordpress.org (checksum, CVE) · cron giornaliero","icon":""},{"id":"sp-8","term":"Ripristino","definition":"Bonifica guidata, quarantena reversibile, rigenerazione salt, report incidente","icon":""},{"id":"sp-9","term":"Registro","definition":"Audit log su tabella dedicata · export CSV · 90 giorni","icon":""},{"id":"sp-10","term":"Licenza","definition":"GPLv2 or later · WP Plugin Check 0 errori / 0 warning","icon":""}],"layout":"stacked","show_icon":false,"separator":true,"striped":false,"term_color":"#FAF7F2","term_font_size":"14","term_font_weight":"700","definition_color":"#B9BDC9","definition_font_size":"14","border_color":"rgba(250,247,242,.12)","spacing":"14","text_align":"left"},"style":[],"advanced":[]}]}]},{"id":"678c2282-e5f9-4e0a-aca2-1bf3e184d325","type":"row","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"layout":"25-75","stack_mobile":true},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"99b33c12-d7a6-4c09-9351-b22275365f0c","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"1-4"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[]},{"id":"a0aafa7b-8d41-4dde-8018-f72d5ac3de2a","type":"column","settings":{"bg":{"type":"none"},"width_medium":"3-4","flex_direction":"row","flex_wrap":"wrap","flex_align":"center","flex_column_gap":"12","flex_row_gap":"12"},"style":[],"advanced":[],"children":[{"id":"d13cc8a1-f213-4884-ac0c-e69ff35e95d9","type":"button","settings":{"text":"← Torna alla scheda prodotto","url":"/olosecurity/","alignment":"left","bg